  "sourceLocator": {
    "chapter": "Gameplay Toolbox",
    "section": "9.43",
    "heading": "Harvesting Poison",
    "lineStart": 14156,
    "lineEnd": 14158
  },
  "section": "9.43",
  "rulesText": "A character can attempt to harvest poison from a venomous creature that is dead or has the Incapacitated condition. The effort takes 1d6 minutes, after which the character makes a DC 20 Intelligence (Nature) check using a Poisoner's Kit. On a successful check, the character harvests enough poison for a single dose, and no additional poison can be harvested from that creature. On a failed check, the character is unable to extract any poison. If the character fails the check by 5 or more, the character is subjected to the creature's poison."
}
